# WS1-02/WS3-03. Source: spec/04-expressions.md §3 (strictly left-to-right:
# call arguments left to right, binary left operand first; struct/array/
# template pieces in source order) and §5 (x++ yields the old value, ++x the new).
expect: output
contrast: pair(next(), next()); ==> pair(next() * 10, next());
contrast-expect: output
--- output
10 1
2 2
1 2
-1
1 2 3
--- contrast-output
10 1
2 2
10 2
-1
1 2 3
